WEBVTT

00:00:03.189 --> 00:00:06.541
Open Artificial Intelligence, Provider Connections.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:12.069
The connections of the site are listed here, and below them the ones from configuration.

00:00:12.522 --> 00:00:14.182
Click Add Connection.

00:00:14.182 --> 00:00:18.734
The window lists one provider for each provider feature you enabled.

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:20.702
Click Add on Azure OpenAI.

00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:23.030
Give the connection a Title.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:27.172
The Technical name is filled in from it, and cannot be changed later.

00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:33.235
Paste the Endpoint from your provider's portal, and choose how the site signs in:

00:00:33.235 --> 00:00:37.364
default authentication, a managed identity, or an API key.

00:00:37.879 --> 00:00:40.093
With an API key, paste it here.

00:00:40.093 --> 00:00:45.299
When you edit the connection later, leave the field blank to keep the stored key.

00:00:45.752 --> 00:00:46.737
Click Save.

00:00:46.737 --> 00:00:51.026
The site checks the fields, but it does not contact the provider, so

00:00:51.026 --> 00:00:54.272
a wrong key shows up the first time someone chats.

